CONtester - STFS management utility
===============

A tool for manipulating Xbox 360 CON packages, with a priority on file
management. Accepts drag & drop operations in addition to opening CON files
from the menu, and has a rehash & resign feature.

The library
-----------

ISOLib now lives in this repository as source under `ISOLib/` and is built as
part of `CONTester.slnx`. There is no longer a separate binary dependency.

ISOLib was originally written by PureIso and Jappi88. The copy here has been
retargeted from .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8 and given a `RWStream.Close(bool)`
compatibility overload. Original author credits and research credits remain in
`ISOLib/About.cs`.

Building
--------

Both projects target .NET Framework 4.8. CONtester builds as AnyCPU by default;
the solution also has explicit x86 configurations if a 32-bit build is wanted.

    msbuild CONTester.slnx /t:Build /p:Configuration=Release

CI and release workflows live in `.github/workflows`. The release workflow
builds Release, merges `CONtester.exe` and `ISOLib.dll` with ILMerge into a
single lean executable, and attaches it to a GitHub release named from the
assembly version and short commit hash. .NET Framework 4.8 ships with Windows,
so no separate runtime or framework-dependent bundle is published.
